-white-flash-handoff","actorId":"1581","skillRef":"158100007","sourceId":"asgater-phoenix","sourceParagraph":64,"signal":"长特殊技时画面闪白","signalEn":"White flash during held Special Attack","handoff":"normal-switch-to-next","gates":["in-combat","floating-radiance-120","stance-shift"],"text":"作者以白闪作为提前交棒信号；不等快速支援提示。相变的资源与姿态条件仍须满足。","textEn":"The author uses the white flash as the early handoff cue without waiting for a Quick Assist prompt. Phase Flow resource and stance prerequisites still apply.","evidenceType":"author-observation-not-measured-frame"},{"id":"phoenix-purifying-flame-handoff","actorId":"1641","skillRef":"164100002","sourceId":"pangci-phoenix","sourceParagraph":29,"handoff":"normal-switch-during-author-confirmed-continuation","gates":["pyre-at-least-90","attack-already-started","target-anomaly-at-finishing-hit"],"text":"作者确认焚罪可交棒，后台仍可触发属性异常；本队教程接维琳娜强化特殊技。未知时长，不保证维的任意多段招式都能塞进同一窗口。","textEn":"The author confirms Purifying Flame can continue off field and still trigger an Attribute Anomaly. The team guide hands off to Velina for an EX; no unmeasured sequence of multiple attacks is assumed to fit.","evidenceType":"author-observation-not-measured-frame"},{"id":"phoenix-basic4-handoff-limitation","actorId":"1641","skillRef":"164100001","sourceId":"pangci-phoenix","sourceParagraph":31,"signal":"第四段普攻跳起","signalEn":"Leap during Basic Attack hit 4","text":"作者允许A4跳起时交棒，但指出后台A4不能触发异常爆条；本轮需要菲先触发火异常时，保留前台命中。","textEn":"The author allows a handoff during the Basic 4 leap but notes that off-field Basic 4 cannot trigger Anomaly buildup completion. Keep Phoenix on field when this hit must trigger Fire Anomaly.","evidenceType":"author-observation-not-measured-frame"}],"windowGuidance":[{"id":"dan-ultimate-stun","sourceId":"asgater-phoenix","sourceParagraph":66,"text":"作者建议丹终结技留给实际失衡轮；非失衡轮以登场与长普兑现。","textEn":"The author suggests saving Dan’s Ultimate for an actual Stun rotation and using entry plus held Basic outside it."},{"id":"burst-owner-choice","sourceId":"asgater-phoenix","sourceParagraph":67,"text":"一般可在失衡前让丹兑现再交菲；丹配置远高于菲时可让丹使用失衡窗口。20金默认可先展示丹窗口，但这不是依金数计算出的最高伤害。","textEn":"The author normally cashes Dan out before Stun and gives Phoenix the window, but favors Dan when her build is much more invested. The 20-gold preset can prioritize Dan as a teaching choice, not as a computed damage optimum."}],"animationTimingVerified":false,"maxScoreVerified":false}}}
